* Every word of length ` N + 1 ` is a letter followed by a word of length ` N `.  This is the step of an induction on the length of a list, the form the cons equation lemmas of this block (~ mulallcs , ~ prodlcs , ~ extractgocss , ...) are stated in; set.mm's own ~ wrdind appends at the end instead, which those equations do not match.

