qed:s17,c10,s32:rspcedvd |- ( ( ( W e. Word S /\ N e. NN0 ) /\ ( # ` W ) = ( N + 1 ) ) -> E. p e. S E. u e. Word S ( ( # ` u ) = N /\ W = ( <" p "> ++ u ) ) )
